Violently fold the space between yourself and another point within range.

You teleport to the target location, and leave a temporal wake behind that stuns for [3, 4, 5, 6, 7 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns and deals [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal and [70, 94, 113, 129, 143 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] physical warp damage to targets in the path.

The damage will scale with your Spellpower.
